options.description:
list the records whose winning copy points at the record (a reference counts, not its cell);
--json adds it as "refs" (needs a record: not with the --plugin listing). In a whole load order
this reads every plugin and takes a while; --plugin reads only the plugin and its masters.

keep only records whose EditorID matches this .NET regular expression (letter case ignored);
without --type it searches every record type. --max limits the list (default 100; 0 lists them all).
With --plugin, only the records that plugin holds (new or overridden) are listed.
